{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0006587 serotonin biosynthetic process from L-tryptophan\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/31658\n\nThis term will be replaced by the parent term, GO:0042427, serotonin biosynthetic process\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Lmrr1jn8P5bAqKxh7Qryn0B36zrWH4F4WNnLXdHY4cg/edit?usp=sharing\n\nImpacted groups: \n\nFlyBase 5 DONE\nRGD 2\n~UniProt 6~ DONE\nWormBase 1\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nNo mappings.\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-03-18T23:33:29Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0006587 serotonin biosynthetic process from L-tryptophan", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-05-26T08:36:09Z"}
